# ==============================================================================
# 13_full_bench_suite.track
# Comprehensive Elevated Bench Validation Suite (All Commands & Features)
# ==============================================================================

# 1. Establish baseline speed & verify link
SPEED 160
PING
WAIT 0.5
CLEAR_ERRORS
WAIT 0.3

# 2. Linear motion checks
FORWARD 2.0
WAIT 0.5
BACKWARD 2.0
WAIT 0.5

# 3. Differential curvature turns
TURN_LEFT 1.5
WAIT 0.5
TURN_RIGHT 1.5
WAIT 0.5

# 4. In-place pivot spins
SPIN_LEFT 1.5
WAIT 0.5
SPIN_RIGHT 1.5
WAIT 0.5

# 5. Speed override transitions
FORWARD 1.5 220
WAIT 0.5
BACKWARD 1.5 120
WAIT 0.5

# 6. Final stop and ping confirmation
STOP
PING
